    "detailed_description": "This is a VR casual 3D golf mini-game, players can control the game through the controller, and hit the golf ball into the designated position to clear the level and unlock the next level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040810/extras/1.jpg?t=1722999538\" /></span>  <br> <br>The game has a total of 6 levels, each with different terrain or obstacles, and players need to adjust their strategies and skills according to different environments and conditions. During the game, players need to master a certain amount of strength and direction in order to accurately hit the golf ball into the designated position.<br>This game is not very difficult, and the VR equipment will be very fun and relaxing for players to use, while exercising players' reflexes and hand-eye coordination, it can also allow players to experience the fun of golf in an immersive way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040810/extras/2.jpg?t=1722999538\" /></span> <br><br>Operation method\uff1a<br>Using the golf club to hit the golf ball into the hole that under big red arrow<br>walk :    Left handle up / down / left / right<br>Turn :    Right handle left / right<br>Menu :   Any handle menu key",
